"PulseBar controls the keyboard": "PulseBar 正在控制键盘",
"PulseBar keeps the keyboard memory in step with the profiles by itself: colours and effects of the zones (for a profile with key colours — its base colour), dimming, G-keys with one key combination or a media key. They work when PulseBar is not running. A full backup is made before the first write.": "PulseBar 会自动让键盘存储与配置文件保持一致：区域的颜色和效果（按键自定义的配置文件使用其基础颜色）、调暗、单个组合键或媒体键的 G 键。未运行 PulseBar 时它们也能使用。首次写入前会完整备份。",
"Replace the three profiles in the keyboard with the factory ones? A backup is made first. The next change of the profiles writes them again.": "要将键盘中的三个配置文件替换为出厂配置吗？会先进行备份。下次更改配置文件时会再次写入。",
